    <briefdescription>
<para>Owns a <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref>&apos;s pre-built vertex bytes and the metadata required to use them safely. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A cache is valid only for the vertex layout and point count recorded when it was installed or rebuilt. Invalidating a cache preserves its allocation for reuse; clearing it also releases the stored bytes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
